* ''The stories' leans'' (operator, 2026-11-07: //"Pono, approve your leans, flow on OODA-HA"//, closing the user-story talk-out of both shores). (1) One labelled genesis re-bake runs in the pre-rite, after every version burn and the lease end state land, so the founding inherits no version literal. (2) The memory stage writes plain tiddlers freely; a daemon or kahua code act still takes the hand gesture the ward ruling names (2026-11-04); a cold read of the kahua-memory-stage carrier confirms the reading before `L4p` opens. (3) The founding stands one operator with many faces; the operator's daughter stands her own hearth at `M8` (#/rulings, the live test and the fence). (4) The vessel's force-kill of a wedged worker stands only as a named `LIVENESS` bound, checked where `clock-sweep` and `b5b` meet. (5) The secrets vault builds before `L30`: the daemon drives the swarm only once its credentials rest in the vault, never on a surface.

